     <td style="padding-top:0in;text-indent:7.2pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;border-bottom:0.5pt solid;padding-right:0in;"><p style="margin-left:1.333%;text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:3pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Compensation that is payable contingent on the achievement of associated performance conditions, i.e., annual incentive compensation and performance-based long-term incentive awards</span></p></td>
    </tr>
