  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">MBIA Inc.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><div><ix:nonNumeric id="F_171b9508-ca6e-4c88-b04b-fed28072e0ef" contextRef="C_58fcb4f8-6548-4929-818a-f06ae4848042" name="ecd:PvpTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_171b9508-ca6e-4c88-b04b-fed28072e0ef_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;" id="pay_versus_performance_table_and_support"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Pa</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">y Versus Performance Table and Supporting Narrative for 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The following section contains information regarding &#8220;compensation actually paid&#8221; to our Named Executive Officers (NEOs) and the relationship between those amounts and certain company performance metrics.</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:Ar